### List tasks
GET http://localhost:3001/tasks HTTP/1.1

### Get task by ID
GET http://localhost:3001/tasks/3 HTTP/1.1

### Create task
POST http://localhost:3001/tasks HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title":"Another task1",
    "completed":false
}


### Create task with form data
POST http://localhost:3001/tasks HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

title=Another+task&completed=false



### Get task by ID
GET http://localhost:3001/tasks?search?=my title HTTP/1.1

POST http://localhost:3001/tasks HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
x-

{
    "title":"Another task1",
    "completed":false
}